Third-party notices
===================

DocsMasked Relay includes third-party software, test fixtures and TypeScript ports of
detection rules. This file aggregates the notices for components distributed with the
project. The extension source also carries `extension/NOTICE`; keep both files in sync.

docs_masked
-----------

This product includes TypeScript ports of PERSON, ORG and ADDRESS detection rules from
docs_masked (https://github.com/kpshinnik/docs_masked), commit
905f92362d574351c1f9b22f56685facffa42c54.

